Description: Blender integration through the Model Context Protocol
 This package provides an MCP (Model Context Protocol) server that
 exposes Blender's scene manipulation, object creation and rendering
 capabilities to MCP-compatible AI assistants.
 .
 This is an application, installed as the blender-mcp command.
